  "body": "Add opt-in Okuma Super-NURBS / Hi-Cut Pro (`G131` / `G130`) high-speed contouring support to `assets/posts/okuma-osp.cps`. Build this after the core post (#1964).\n\n## Requirements\n- Keep Super-NURBS smoothing disabled by default via a post property (`G131` alarms on OSP controls that lack the installed software option).\n- When enabled and `PARAM Smoothing` is active, write `G131` with `E` (chordal tolerance from `Smoothing`), `F` (maximum feed limit), and `J` mode (`J1` finish vs `J2` rough from `PARAM SmoothingMode`).\n- Cancel active smoothing with `G130` at section end, before any tool change, and before program end (`M02`/`M30`).\n- Follow the `assets/posts/doosan-dnm.cps` and `assets/posts/haas.cps` smoothing property and test patterns (`crates/app/tests/smoothing.rs`).\n\nDone means: smoothing stays off by default, writes valid `G131`/`G130` blocks when enabled on rough and finish ops, cancels cleanly before tool changes and end, and passes smoothing tests.\n\nPart of #1959\n",
